# Example ReRDMFT input file: CASCI on LiH (NON_REL): CASCI TRUE does only the first CI solve on the fixed SCF orbitals
# (CASSCF_INIT CORE would use the core-Hamiltonian orbitals instead), with no orbital optimization.
NELEC 4
BASIS lih-6-31g.gbs
NON_RELATIVISTIC TRUE
CASSCF TRUE
CASCI TRUE
CASSCF_ELECTRONS 2
CASSCF_SPINORS 4

GEOMETRY
Li  0.000000   0.000000   0.000000
H   0.000000   0.000000   1.594900
END
